<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 100,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Actual interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Tuesday were 100,000 head, compared with the estimate of 105,000, USDA reported.</p>
<p>Opening trade not well established.  Early sales Barrows and Gilts mostly steady to $0.50 per cwt higher than the midsession Tuesday.</p>
<p>				  Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
